        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CIRSOL, Soleil Knob with Circulaire Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Soleil Knob with Circulaire Rosette is available in a wide array of stunning finishes. The uniqueness of the Soleil Knobset is perfect for people who want to make a fashion statement. The Grandeur Circulaire Rosette with Soleil Knob is easy to install, and it will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CIRSOL Circulaire Rosette with Soleil Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Soleil Knob with Circulaire Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CIRSOL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262389\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CIRSOL Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working, knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Soleil Knob with Circulaire Rosette",
                "description": "The Soleil Knob with Circulaire Rosette is available in a wide array of stunning finishes. The uniqueness of the Soleil Knobset is perfect for people who want to make a fashion statement. The Grandeur Circulaire Rosette with Soleil Knob is easy to install, and it will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Soleil Knob with Circulaire Rosettes, Grandeur CIRSOL, Circulaire Rosette with Soleil Knobs, GRA-CIRSOL, Soleil Knob with Circulaire Roses, Grandeur CIRSOL Circulaire Rosette with Soleil Knobs, Soleil Knob with Circulaire Rosettes,"
